text:
Use code-
BVO-PRAMITAHALDER
for extra 20% discount (in bella vita website/app)

@lakshaythakurrr

I really enjoy your videos. But I think it might be time to level up a bit and try perfumes from brands like Menworks and Ababel. I understand that your content is aimed at a general audience, but your recommendation have a big influence on viewers.

Even for regular people, saving a little extra money can help us get much better value for what we buy. Most of us don’t purchase perfumes very often we usually buy just 2-3 bottles at a time and use them for a long period. Because of that, it would be great to see some options beyond the usual Wild Stone, Bella Vita, and Fogg, and explore slightly higher  quality choices that still offer good value.
